            <title>3.24.1</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:21:05 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>222</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.24.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- Moving a session to another folder from a pane that shows another Mac's session no longer needs someone at that Mac's screen: the confirmation also appears on the Mac you are watching from, and either Mac can answer. Once one answers, the other Mac's confirmation closes
- A failed move now shows an error in the panes watching that session from other Macs
- A pane showing another Mac's session now updates its folder name after the session moves there, instead of keeping the old name
]]></description>
